    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, I haven't really refined the art of Slot Addition.",
      "translation" : "嗯，我还没有完全掌握添加插槽的技术。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's so complicated that I'd be lying if I told you that I knew every factor that affected the process.",
      "translation" : "这个过程太复杂了，要是说我知道影响成功率的所有因素，那就是在撒谎。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Still, I do notice a few trends...",
      "translation" : "不过，我确实发现了一些规律..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In some towns, Slot addition attempts are more successful for equipment with fewer upgrades.",
      "translation" : "有些城镇里，精炼次数较少的装备更容易成功添加插槽。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In other towns, the opposite is true.",
      "translation" : "另一些城镇则正好相反。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "isn't that really peculiar?",
      "translation" : "这不是很奇怪吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, there's also something really important that you should know.",
      "translation" : "还有一件非常重要的事，你一定要知道。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you ask me to add a Slot to something, make sure that you don't have multiples of it in your inventory.",
      "translation" : "如果要我为某件装备添加插槽，请确保背包里没有多件同名装备。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 232,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Here's an example: if you have a +7 Manteau and a normal Manteau in your inventory, then I will randomly pick one of them for my Slot Addition attempt.",
      "translation" : "举个例子：如果你的背包里有一件+7斗篷和一件普通斗篷，我会随机挑选其中一件来尝试添加插槽。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Just remember to be careful.",
      "translation" : "记得小心一点。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 237,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Again, ^FF0000only carry one of the equipment to which you want me to add a Slot^000000.",
      "translation" : "再说一次，^FF0000只带一件你想让我添加插槽的装备^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "All other equipment with the same name should be placed in your Kafra Storage, got it?",
      "translation" : "其他同名装备都应该放进卡普拉仓库，明白了吗？"
